  "details": "JeecgBoot through 3.9.5 contains a missing authorization vulnerability in the AiOcrController updateById handler that allows any authenticated user to modify global OCR templates. Low-privileged attackers can send PUT requests to /airag/ocr/edit to overwrite LLM prompts in the shared airag:ocr Redis key, corrupting OCR results for all users.",
